  "extensionName": {
    "message": "Aubade"
  },
  "extensionDescription": {
    "message": "A new tab page built on the twelve phases of the day. The background moves with the light, from nautical dawn through zenith to nightfall. Clock, greeting, search, to-dos and a photo wall you can drag anywhere. No account, no server, everything stays in your own browser."
  },
